  "nl_spec": "Below is existing build123d code for a plain bushing. Enlarge the bore from \u00d820 mm to \u00d824 mm while keeping the outside diameter (30 mm) and length (40 mm) unchanged. The edited part's material volume must not exceed 13,000 mm^3.\n\n```python\nfrom build123d import BuildPart, Cylinder, Mode\n\nwith BuildPart() as bushing:\n    Cylinder(radius=15, height=40)\n    Cylinder(radius=10, height=40, mode=Mode.SUBTRACT)\n\nresult = bushing.part\n```",
